{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LSEe0SJ3131792655543.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名內地旅客偷運犬隻入境被捕。<br/></p><p>海關昨日在落馬洲支線管制站，截查一名55歲內地女子，在其行李內檢獲一隻懷疑非法進口活犬，約值1.5萬元，案件轉交漁農自然護理署跟進調查。</p><p></p><p>根據《狂犬病規例》，非法輸入動物或動物產品等，最高可判罰款五萬元及監禁一年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:41:35.838501+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:42.815006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:51.141647+00:00","content_hash":"366c7b3c4cc6f2778772db7eb25537afd6c45e1d1c6e65212e6c274177d757a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}